WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome back. Today we talk about agency disclosure in Texas.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Every license holder must explain who they represent.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:12.000
So before you talk about price or terms, hand them the IABS form.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:18.000
That is the Information About Brokerage Services notice.
